{"version":1,"content":"<p>根據美國廣播公司（ABC News）、《華盛頓郵報》與益普索（Ipsos）聯合發佈的一項最新民意調查，多數美國成年人對人工智能的發展持負面看法，同時反對繼續大規模建設數據中心。調查顯示，57%的受訪者認為人工智能對社會弊大於利，66%反對在美國建設新的數據中心；如果數據中心建在自己所在的社區，反對比例進一步升至72%。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583478.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:43:51.891711+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T05:22:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T05:38:06.572122+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T05:38:06.572122+00:00","content_hash":"91c37efff018ce0b5215c47d6ef4d0682a348ef36456957cd0300abe7922d274","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}